      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>It seems the docker host name and portmappings are opaque for containerized applications.  An easy way to avoid the misguiding usage message is to mention docker and the fact that the endpoint URL might be actually localhost:9080 (docker-compose default).</p>\n\n<p>There is a common but undocumented way by checking for the existence of the .dockerenv file.</p>",
     "created": "07/Feb/22 9:31 AM",
