  "description": "<p>The Camel reindexing endpoint provided a usage message with examples. The generated links in those examples should contain the services hostname in the URLs. When running in a Docker environment resolving the local hostname fails, leading to unresolvable URLs e.g:</p>\n\n<p><tt>Configured REST endpoint: 0f4c88fb87f6:9080/reindexing</tt></p>\n\n<p><b>How to reproduce</b></p>\n\n<div class=\"preformatted panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"preformattedContent panelContent\">\n<pre>$ git clone git@github.com:fcrepo-exts/fcrepo-camel-toolbox.git\n$ cd fcrepo-camel-toolbox/docker-compose\n$ docker-compose up\n$ curl localhost:9080/reindexing</pre>\n</div></div>",
